   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of LO-TCo Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnd &apos;Models for    union development cooperation - Evaluation of LO-TCo Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnd &quot;Models for</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Evaluation of LO-TCo Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnd &apos;Models for    union development cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The evaluation aims to map, alayze and leave recommenations           concerning: the relevance in relation to the Strag for support via    Swedish CSO&apos;s 2010-2015, The added value, ownership and               cost-effektiveness including conditions to forwarding                 SIDA-contribution to local partners in relation to the                organizations&apos;s goals and LO-TCO Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnd&apos;s models for</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rderingen syftar till kartl&#xe4;gga, analysera och l&#xe4;mna              rekommendationer avseende: relevans i relation till Strategin f&#xf6;r     st&#xf6;d genom svenska organisationer i det civila samh&#xe4;llet 2010-2015,   Merv&#xe4;rde, &#xe4;garskap och kostnadseffektivitet inklusive f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar att vidaref&#xf6;rmedla SIDA-bidrag till lokala partner i relation till    verksamhetens m&#xe5;l och utifr&#xe5;n LO-TCO B:s samarbetsmodeller.</narrative>
  </description>
